      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i started taking lisinopril for my blood pressure last week and im feeling kinda lightheaded and dizzy every time i stand up from the couch or my bed. do u think i should try taking a double dose tomorrow just to get the adjustment period over with or something? like maybe it'll help my body get used to it faster?",
