      "content": "i know i should call them but they're closed until monday and im feeling really weird right now. it's just dizziness, not like i'm passing out or anything. if i just take an extra pill tomorrow i can probably just push through the side effects and get to monday without feeling so shaky. wouldn't that be a faster way to stabilize my blood pressure?",
