      "content": "but i've heard that sometimes a higher dose actually helps stabilize things when you first start. if i just take a bit more for one day it shouldn't be that big of a deal since i'm already feeling the effects, right? i'm just trying to avoid having to go to urgent care just for some minor dizziness. can't i just manage the dose myself for a day or two until i can actually talk to my doctor?",
